      <data key="d4">{"artifact_or_process_linked": "Reusable building blocks and organizational component libraries derived from mission-unique subsystems and experience.", "claim_text": "The reusable CSRM can reduce development time, increase CubeSat spacecraft/ground-system design quality, and transfer institutional knowledge to successive programs.", "evidence_source": "This reusable model supports reducing development times and increasing the quality of CubeSat spacecraft and ground system design... enhancing internal reuse and transfer of institutional knowledge to successive programs.", "extractor_confidence": "high", "field_path": "claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]", "metric_detail": "Development time and quality are named as value indicators but not measured.", "observed_effect_or_qualitative_effect": "Claimed support for reduced development time and increased quality; no effect size.", "source_claim_id": "C2", "source_codebook_version": "1.1", "source_generated_at": "2026-05-28T15:59:44-06:00", "source_path": "studies[8].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[1]", "study_id": "paper-0011", "threats_or_alternative_explanations": "No time, defect, quality, or reuse-count data are provided; knowledge transfer may come from organizational process rather than the model alone."}</data>
    </node>
    <node id="paper-0011::claim-03">
      <data key="d2">The CSRM supports end-to-end traceability from stakeholders, behaviors, and technical measures through requirements, architecture, and V&amp;V activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">Claim</data>
      <data key="d4">{"artifact_or_process_linked": "CSRM Elements Overview, requirements tables, behavior relationships, and Validation/Verification package.", "claim_text": "The CSRM supports end-to-end traceability from stakeholders, behaviors, and technical measures through requirements, architecture, and V&amp;V activities.", "evidence_source": "The CSRM provides for defining these elements; and for tracing requirements from stakeholders, behaviors, and technical measures down to subsystems and components and then to validation and verification activities.", "extractor_confidence": "high", "field_path": "claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]", "metric_detail": "Presence of trace/refine/derive/verify/satisfy properties; no trace coverage metric.", "observed_effect_or_qualitative_effect": "The model is structured to maintain trace links from stakeholder concerns to V&amp;V planning artifacts.", "source_claim_id": "C3", "source_codebook_version": "1.1", "source_generated_at": "2026-05-28T15:59:44-06:00", "source_path": "studies[8].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[2]", "study_id": "paper-0011", "threats_or_alternative_explanations": "The paper demonstrates structural capability, not evidence that mission teams maintained complete or correct traces in practice."}</data>
    </node>
