    <node id="paper-0014::claim-02">
      <data key="d2">The CSRM supports traceability from stakeholders and requirements through behaviors, technical measures, and validation/verification activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">Claim</data>
      <data key="d4">{"artifact_or_process_linked": "Stakeholder elements, requirement blocks, behavior elements, MOE/MOP/TPM specifications, Validation/Verification Activity blocks.", "claim_text": "The CSRM supports traceability from stakeholders and requirements through behaviors, technical measures, and validation/verification activities.", "extractor_confidence": "high", "field_path": "claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]", "observed_effect_or_qualitative_effect": "Structural capability only: trace fields and V&amp;V links exist in the reference model.", "quote_location": ["Section 2, lines 111-113: 'The CSRM integrates five overarching elements: stakeholders, technical measures, behaviors, requirements, and architecture. The CSRM provides for defining and tracing requirements from stakeholders, to behaviors, with technical measures assigned to subsystems and components to be certified through validation and verification activities.'", "Figure 1 description, line 122: the Requirements section lists Mission/CubeSat/Ground/Subsystem/Component/Deployer Interface Requirement blocks with fields including 'DerivedFrom', 'RefinedBy', 'SatisfiedBy', 'VerifiedBy', 'TracedFrom', and 'TracedTo'.", "Figure 1 description, line 126: 'The Technical Measures section includes blocks for \"MOE Specification\" ... \"MOP Specification,\" and \"TPM Specification\"... The Validation Verification section contains \"Validation Activity\" and \"Verification Activity\" blocks, each with fields for Plan, Procedure, Conduct, Result, Status, and Active Hyperlink.'"], "source_claim_id": "C2", "source_codebook_version": "1.1", "source_generated_at": "2026-05-28T15:59:44-06:00", "source_path": "studies[11].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[1]", "study_id": "paper-0014", "threats_or_alternative_explanations": "The existence of trace fields does not demonstrate actual mission-team traceability completeness, correctness, or impact on verification outcomes."}</data>
