    <node id="paper-0014::claim-04">
      <data key="d2">Technical measures and parametrics in the CSRM can support early mission-level decisions and trade-space negotiation, including satellite count/orbits, ground stations, payload configuration, storage, downlink, and power/energy considerations.</data>
      <data key="d3">Claim</data>
