      <data key="d4">{"artifact_or_process_linked": "Magic System of Systems Architect verification model, Magic Model Analyst, Python client, parametric diagrams, requirements compliance matrix.", "claim_text": "The MBSE verification model can command the test setup and use parametric diagrams to validate exchanged data and confirm requirements compliance during test runs.", "evidence_source": "The parametric diagrams within, validate the data exchanged and confirm the requirements compliance. The requirements are verified simultaneously with the test runs", "field_path": "claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]", "observed_effect_or_qualitative_effect": "Qualitatively reports simultaneous requirements verification with test runs and model-flow assessment; no pass/fail results reported.", "source_claim_id": "C3", "source_codebook_version": "1.1", "source_generated_at": "2026-05-28T15:59:44-06:00", "source_path": "studies[32].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[2]", "study_id": "paper-0063", "threats_or_alternative_explanations": "The paper does not report actual parameter values, compliance outcomes, or error cases; 'reliability' is model-flow thoroughness, not spacecraft reliability."}</data>
    </node>
    <node id="paper-0063::claim-04">
      <data key="d2">Automatic updating of the CATIA Magic Requirements Table from verification-model test outcomes reduced time spent documenting and reporting test outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d3">Claim</data>
      <data key="d4">{"artifact_or_process_linked": "CATIA Magic Requirements Table and requirements compliance reporting.", "claim_text": "Automatic updating of the CATIA Magic Requirements Table from verification-model test outcomes reduced time spent documenting and reporting test outcomes.", "evidence_source": "The Requirements Table in CATIA Magic tool gets updated automatically based on the test outcomes from running the verification model each time. This reduced huge amount of time spent on documenting and reporting the test outcomes to confirm the requirements compliance.", "field_path": "claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]", "observed_effect_or_qualitative_effect": "Authors state a 'huge' reduction in documentation/reporting time; no quantitative effect size.", "source_claim_id": "C4", "source_codebook_version": "1.1", "source_generated_at": "2026-05-28T15:59:44-06:00", "source_path": "studies[32].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[3]", "study_id": "paper-0063", "threats_or_alternative_explanations": "No measured before/after baseline, effort log, or independent validation is provided; improvement may depend on case-specific test-script integration."}</data>
    </node>
