      <data key="d7">communication/stakeholder alignment</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">Section 2: 'A CubeSat architecture framework ... can provide a traceability map for translating the mission objectives and mission requirements into basic building blocks of CubeSat system components, interfaces and tasks.' Section 2: 'The system requirements when flowed through this block get broken down into components, interfaces, and tasks as basic building blocks.'</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"claim_id": "paper-0008::claim-02", "claim_text": "The CubeSat architecture framework provides traceability from mission objectives and mission requirements to system components, interfaces, tasks, and operating modes.", "evidence_confidence": "Weak", "observed_effect": "The paper shows/argues the traceability map but does not quantify link coverage or defect reduction.", "source_claim_id": "C2", "source_path": "studies[6].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[1]", "source_record_id": "paper-0008::claim-02", "study_id": "paper-0008"}</data>
