      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">Section 5 Use Case 2: 'The payload for the mission may be reused from a previous mission enterprise that exists in a PLM system ... Generate a SysML block structure from the payload model in Windchill and use it in the context of a new CubeSat design.' Section 5: 'This may be a preliminary design, perhaps submitted for purposes of mass and/or cost calculation.'</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"claim_id": "paper-0008::claim-06", "claim_text": "A payload part structure from a previous mission can be reused from PLM to generate a SysML block structure for a new CubeSat design, replacing placeholders and supporting mass/cost calculations.", "evidence_confidence": "Weak", "observed_effect": "Illustrated reuse of previous mission payload structure in a new CubeSat context; the previous mission is a source of reused structure rather than an evaluated comparator, and no reuse effort or error reduction metric is reported.", "source_claim_id": "C6", "source_path": "studies[6].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[5]", "source_record_id": "paper-0008::claim-06", "study_id": "paper-0008"}</data>
