      <data key="d7">effort reduction</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">"The integration of formal methods into the design process of a complex system can reduce the need for a significant amount testing during the system integration phase because of the "correct by construction" nature of the process. This leads to testing virtually at each level of refinement."</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
