    <edge source="paper-0022::claim-07" target="outcomecategory::communication_stakeholder_alignment" id="e0000638">
      <data key="d5">CLAIMS_OUTCOME</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[].outcome_category</data>
      <data key="d7">communication/stakeholder alignment</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">Section III.B: 'The SSWG team is developing a model distribution process to share to external entities...' Figure 9 lists 'MagicDraw, ZIP File, XMI File, OpenMBEE, and Teamcenter.' Conclusion: team 'hopes to release the models publicly in the near future.'</data>
