    <edge source="paper-0033::claim-02" target="outcomecategory::automation" id="e0000781">
      <data key="d5">CLAIMS_OUTCOME</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[].outcome_category</data>
      <data key="d7">automation</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">By using the MAM and automatically generating the input configuration script, the user is no longer required to understand how the simulator source code works, and does not have to manually code the configurations for each scenario, permitting a straightforward use of the simulator. Also, it is much more practical and faster to change scenario parameters in the model than manually in the configuration script</data>
      <data key="d10" />
      <data key="d11">{"claim_id": "paper-0033::claim-02", "claim_text": "Automatically generating the ForPlan configuration script from the MAM removes the need for users to understand simulator source code or manually code each scenario, making scenario changes more practical and faster.", "evidence_confidence": "Weak", "observed_effect": "Qualitatively asserted easier and faster scenario parameter changes; generated script excerpt demonstrates feasibility.", "source_claim_id": "C2", "source_path": "studies[21].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[1]", "source_record_id": "paper-0033::claim-02", "study_id": "paper-0033"}</data>
