      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">The data structures and expected behaviors were captured in such a way that can unambiguously understood well enough to be implemented, as well as provide full traceability and rationale for architectural elements with minimal configuration management overhead [13].</data>
      <data key="d10" />
