      <data key="d7">consistency</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">As a result, any changes made to the Watchdog Timer specification are automatically propagated to the Power subsystem and to any other subsystems or components with a relationship to the Watchdog Timer. The user does not need to manually propagate this change.</data>
      <data key="d10" />
      <data key="d11">{"claim_id": "paper-0039::claim-03", "claim_text": "Model relationships automatically propagate a Watchdog Timer specification change from ADCS to the Power subsystem and other related elements, avoiding manual propagation and improving consistency/traceability.", "evidence_confidence": "Moderate", "observed_effect": "Concrete model relationship shown; authors claim no manual propagation is needed. No metric for avoided errors or time saved.", "source_claim_id": "C3", "source_path": "studies[24].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[2]", "source_record_id": "paper-0039::claim-03", "study_id": "paper-0039"}</data>
