      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">The Requirements Table in CATIA Magic tool gets updated automatically based on the test outcomes from running the verification model each time. This reduced huge amount of time spent on documenting and reporting the test outcomes to confirm the requirements compliance.</data>
