      <data key="d7">Phase A/B</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">From the case study of DelFFi, it can be observed that the key of both MBSE and MDE-based onboard software development is the model. Therefore a bridge between MBSE and onboard software development can be built up through model sharing.</data>
