    <edge source="paper-0079::claim-04" target="outcomecategory::automation" id="e0001079">
      <data key="d5">CLAIMS_OUTCOME</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[].outcome_category</data>
      <data key="d7">automation</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">If the Simulink Solution works well and the AOCS/GNC algorithms have been executed so far with desirable results in simulation, the C code be generated directly from an executable Simulink Solution. On this basis, the Onboard Software is ready for testing and after some necessary items will be the exact software running in operation.</data>
      <data key="d10" />
      <data key="d11">{"claim_id": "paper-0079::claim-04", "claim_text": "Automatic generation from executable Simulink solutions and consistency between simulation models and onboard software should improve code/product quality and reliability.", "evidence_confidence": "Weak", "observed_effect": "Expected qualitative increase in reliability/quality from structural consistency; no defect, failure, or test metric.", "source_claim_id": "C4", "source_path": "studies[37].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[3]", "source_record_id": "paper-0079::claim-04", "study_id": "paper-0079"}</data>
    </edge>
