    <edge source="paper-0001" target="approachclass::extended_mbse" id="e0001646">
      <data key="d5">HAS_APPROACH_CLASS</data>
      <data key="d6">implementation_pathway_tailoring.approach_classification</data>
      <data key="d7">Extended MBSE</data>
      <data key="d8">The approach connects a SysML system model to multiple analysis/simulation domains and requirements-checking workflows. It does not report downstream hardware/software integration needed for the strongest 'Integrated MBSE/digital engineering' classification.</data>
