    <edge source="paper-0003" target="paper-0003::claim-01" id="e0001970">
      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">An integrated SysML-based modeling environment can extract feasibility, performance, and robustness metrics and visualize physical and functional satellite states for representative RAX mission scenarios.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">The integrated modeling environment enables users to extract feasibility, performance, and robustness metrics. This enables visualization of both the physical states ... and functional states ... of the satellite for representative mission scenarios.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"claim_id": "paper-0003::claim-01", "source_claim_id": "C1", "source_path": "studies[2].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[0]", "source_record_id": "paper-0003::claim-01", "study_id": "paper-0003"}</data>
    </edge>
