      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">A single acausal SysML SNR parametric model can be executed with different causalities to compute link SNR, required downlink power, or achievable data rate.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">ParaMagic can be used to execute a given parametric model for different causalities, such that input and output variables can be switched on-the-fly.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"claim_id": "paper-0003::claim-03", "source_claim_id": "C3", "source_path": "studies[2].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[2]", "source_record_id": "paper-0003::claim-03", "study_id": "paper-0003"}</data>
    </edge>
