      <data key="d7">para-magic-acausal-causality-switching</data>
      <data key="d8">ParaMagic is central to the SNR reuse claim but is not an enumerated controlled tool label; it enables solving the same SysML parametric model with different target/given variables.</data>
      <data key="d9">ParaMagic can be used to execute a given parametric model for different causalities, such that input and output variables can be switched on-the-fly.</data>
