      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">weak_claim_evidence_linkage</data>
      <data key="d8">Broad claims about full design-test-fly use, near-real-time operational feedback, reuse by future teams, communication, and ROI-like effort benefits are only weakly linked to measured evidence.</data>
      <data key="d9">Absence-based: claim records C5, C8, C9, and C10 have Weak or Unsupported evidence confidence; there are no measured schedule/effort/reuse/stakeholder metrics.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[2].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[12]", "source_record_id": "paper-0003::limitation-13", "study_id": "paper-0003"}</data>
