    <edge source="paper-0003" target="reusemechanism::high_level_abstraction" id="e0005531">
      <data key="d5">HAS_REUSE_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism</data>
      <data key="d7">high-level abstraction</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper is RAX-applied, but it explicitly frames the work as a CubeSat community framework/model-development-kit and template, not merely a one-off RAX model. High-level/logical abstraction is supported by the emphasis on logical operations models and minimizing model complexity. Do not add low-dynamics / non-detailed-behavior model because executable dynamics, power scenarios, and state/activity behavior are central. Do not add specific-mission model with reusable method only because the paper claims a reusable CubeSat framework/template beyond RAX.</data>
      <data key="d9">Our overall plan is to develop a CubeSat model development kit for the CubeSat community</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"confidences": ["medium"], "source_path": null, "source_paths": ["studies[2].extraction.mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism", "studies[2].structured_code_summary.mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism"], "source_record_id": null, "source_record_ids": ["paper-0003::code-0051", "paper-0003::code-0186"], "source_sections": ["extraction", "structured_code_summary"], "status": "coded", "statuses": ["coded"], "study_id": "paper-0003", "value_index": 5}</data>
