      <data key="d5">HAS_REUSE_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism</data>
      <data key="d7">high-level abstraction</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper directly claims a reusable CubeSat reference/project model for mission-specific tailoring, with a component library and process/method guidance. High-level abstraction and mission-agnostic architecture are supported by the logical, typical space-ground architecture intended for customization. Do not code specific-mission model with reusable method only. Do not code low-dynamics / non-detailed-behavior model because limited detail is mainly interim maturity, not a stated reuse mechanism.</data>
      <data key="d9">Develop a CubeSat Reference Model that other projects can use as a starting point for their mission specific CubeSat model.</data>
