      <data key="d5">HAS_APPROACH_CLASS</data>
      <data key="d6">implementation_pathway_tailoring.approach_classification</data>
      <data key="d7">Extended MBSE</data>
      <data key="d8">The approach remains centered in SysML/CRM but spans mission-enterprise, requirements, behavior, structure, validation/verification, external regulatory/service models, and COTS simulation interfaces; it is more than pure SysML but not a fully integrated digital-engineering environment.</data>
