    <edge source="paper-0005" target="ivvintegrationlevel::simulation_in_the_loop" id="e0003755">
      <data key="d5">HAS_IVV_LEVEL</data>
      <data key="d6">eps_verification_specific.ivv_integration_level</data>
      <data key="d7">simulation-in-the-loop</data>
      <data key="d8">The highest evidenced IVV integration is system-level simulation-in-the-loop: the mission-specific CubeSat model is linked to V&amp;V scenarios/mission modeling, and the SysML model/tool is said to execute mission scenarios and interface with COTS tools. This should be qualified as system-level only; no EPS-specific verification procedure, SIL/HIL, or physical integration/test evidence is reported.</data>
      <data key="d9">Figure 10 illustrates that viewpoints into the CRM will provide the objective evidence needed for validation. The CRM will be populated with a representative mission, and then the viewpoints will provide the objective evidence for verification.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"confidences": ["medium"], "source_path": null, "source_paths": ["studies[4].extraction.eps_verification_specific.ivv_integration_level", "studies[4].structured_code_summary.eps_verification_specific.ivv_integration_level"], "source_record_id": null, "source_record_ids": ["paper-0005::code-0063", "paper-0005::code-0167"], "source_sections": ["extraction", "structured_code_summary"], "status": "coded", "statuses": ["coded"], "study_id": "paper-0005", "value_index": 1}</data>
