      <data key="d7">no_eps_specific_evidence</data>
      <data key="d8">Power appears only as a high-level subsystem block; no EPS architecture, requirements, simulations, margins, tests, or outcomes are provided.</data>
      <data key="d9">Figure 2 only documents Power Subsystem as "Generate, regulate, store, and distribute power to the spacecraft."</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[4].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[6]", "source_record_id": "paper-0005::limitation-07", "study_id": "paper-0005"}</data>
