      <data key="d7">high-level abstraction</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper supports a reusable CubeSat architecture/framework beyond RAX: common CubeSat elements form a library/starting point, each mission adapts the framework, model/manual/instructions are reported as available, interfaces/components/tasks are reusable organizing elements, and PLM-to-SysML transformations support reuse of previous-mission structures. Do not code low-dynamics/non-detailed behavior or specific-mission-model-with-reusable-method-only.</data>
