    <edge source="paper-0010" target="ivvintegrationlevel::executable_model_based_checks" id="e0003758">
      <data key="d5">HAS_IVV_LEVEL</data>
      <data key="d6">eps_verification_specific.ivv_integration_level</data>
      <data key="d7">executable/model-based checks</data>
      <data key="d8">At system level, the paper shows formal/model-based verification through PVS proof obligations and type-correctness checks tied to abstraction-level consistency and traceability. The current simulation-in-the-loop coding is overstated because simulations are described conceptually, while the concrete shown check is PVS/TCC-based. No EPS-specific IVV is reported.</data>
      <data key="d9">This section will provide definitions and methodology for insuring a correct-by-construction system through verification across each level of abstraction through consistency checks and refinement traceability between levels of abstraction.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
