    <edge source="paper-0011" target="paper-0011::claim-03" id="e0002019">
      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">The CSRM supports end-to-end traceability from stakeholders, behaviors, and technical measures through requirements, architecture, and V&amp;V activities.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">The CSRM provides for defining these elements; and for tracing requirements from stakeholders, behaviors, and technical measures down to subsystems and components and then to validation and verification activities.</data>
