      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">The CSRM can be adapted to different mission methods because it is methodology-agnostic, provides instructions, and lets teams populate or modify model elements and containment trees.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
