      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_independent_validation</data>
      <data key="d8">Formal review and university use are reported, but the paper gives no independent validation protocol, criteria, data, or replication results for the claimed benefits.</data>
      <data key="d9">Background/Vetting reports review/recommendation and university use but does not state review criteria, independent evaluation data, or outcomes of the university applications.</data>
