      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">The CRM is a reusable instructional and mission-specific starting point for designing and building CubeSats, replacing an earlier RAX-centric model that was not suitable for reuse.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">'Because the initial model was RAX-centric and not suitable for reuse... Develop a CubeSat Reference Model (CRM) that a CubeSat team can use as a starting point for its mission' and 'This model will be a repository for the systems engineering artifacts created by the mission-specific team.'</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"claim_id": "paper-0013::claim-01", "source_claim_id": "C1_reusable_crm_starting_point", "source_path": "studies[10].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[0]", "source_record_id": "paper-0013::claim-01", "study_id": "paper-0013"}</data>
    </edge>
