      <data key="d7">trace-linked verification artifacts</data>
      <data key="d8">The highest supported IVV integration for the current CRM is generic system-level trace-linked verification properties in the model. The paper does not show EPS-specific verification artifacts, a verification matrix, SIL/HIL, simulation-in-loop, or executed model-based checks for the current CRM; power parametrics are future work and RAX power trade studies are background.</data>
