      <data key="d8">The paper explicitly presents the CRM as a reusable CubeSat community starting point and OMG specification candidate, not just a high-level one-off model. Reuse is supported by a template/reference model, model-element library, stereotypes/profiles, generic logical architecture, loose subsystem definitions, table-based population workflow, and user guidance. Do not add interface-focused model or specific-mission model with reusable method only.</data>
