    <edge source="paper-0014" target="interoperabilitymechanism::import_export" id="e0003678">
      <data key="d5">HAS_INTEROPERABILITY_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d6">toolchain_interoperability_lifecycle_continuity.interoperability_mechanisms</data>
      <data key="d7">import/export</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper reports importing OMG CSRM files into a modeling tool and describes transformation from logical architecture to physical design inside the model; no API/XML/XMI/co-simulation mechanism is specified.</data>
