      <data key="d5">HAS_MODELING_SCOPE</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.modeling_scope</data>
      <data key="d7">architecture</data>
      <data key="d8">CSRM covers CubeSat mission/system logical architecture, subsystem/component hierarchy, requirements, behaviors, technical measures/trade factors, space-ground/operations concerns, interfaces, and V&amp;V activity support.</data>
      <data key="d9">Section 2, line 109: 'The CSRM provides a CubeSat logical space-ground architecture. The logical components are abstractions of the physical components that perform the system functionality without imposing implementation constraints.'</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
