    <edge source="paper-0015" target="reusemechanism::high_level_abstraction" id="e0005599">
      <data key="d5">HAS_REUSE_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism</data>
      <data key="d7">high-level abstraction</data>
      <data key="d8">The CRM is a generic, high-abstraction CubeSat reference model intended to be populated and tailored for mission-specific models. Do not code interface-focused model or specific-mission model with reusable method only. Also remove low-dynamics / non-detailed-behavior model: the paper abstracts implementation and physical instantiation, but it does not claim low dynamics or deliberately non-detailed behavior as the reuse mechanism.</data>
      <data key="d9">The CRM is being developed with sufficient flexibility to support customization for specific CubeSat missions by mission-specific CubeSat teams.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
