      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">prototype_or_future_work</data>
      <data key="d8">The current reference-model effort is explicitly incomplete; mission-specific example and validation are future work.</data>
      <data key="d9">Section 6: 'The next step is to create an example mission-specific model and to validate the MOEs and MOPs.'</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "author_stated", "source_path": "studies[13].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[0]", "source_record_id": "paper-0016::limitation-01", "study_id": "paper-0016"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0016" target="limitationflag::single_case_or_limited_scope" id="e0004004">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">single_case_or_limited_scope</data>
      <data key="d8">Prior application evidence is limited to RAX and the current phase is a generic logical CubeSat model rather than multiple mission replications.</data>
      <data key="d9">Recent Phases: 'applied to the Radio Aurora Explorer (RAX), a 3U CubeSat'; Section 6 says the current effort has defined the generic architecture down to logical subsystems.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[13].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[1]", "source_record_id": "paper-0016::limitation-02", "study_id": "paper-0016"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0016" target="limitationflag::weak_claim_evidence_linkage" id="e0004005">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">weak_claim_evidence_linkage</data>
      <data key="d8">Major value claims such as burden reduction and uniformity/consistency are linked to MBSE/reference-model ideas but not empirically demonstrated.</data>
      <data key="d9">Conclusion: 'MBSE holds the promise of reducing the burden...' and the reference model 'can serve as a checklist... and promote uniformity and consistency'.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[13].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[10]", "source_record_id": "paper-0016::limitation-11", "study_id": "paper-0016"}</data>
    </edge>
