    <edge source="paper-0016" target="reusemechanism::high_level_abstraction" id="e0005605">
      <data key="d5">HAS_REUSE_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism</data>
      <data key="d7">high-level abstraction</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper explicitly presents a reusable CubeSat Reference Model/logical architecture adaptable to any CubeSat mission. High-level abstraction and mission-agnostic architecture are supported by the logical-architecture framing and reuse/adaptation claims. Do not code interface-focused model, low-dynamics / non-detailed-behavior model, or specific-mission model with reusable method only.</data>
      <data key="d9">The goal of the team is to provide a sufficiently complete CubeSat Reference Model that can be adapted to any CubeSat project.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"confidences": ["high"], "source_path": null, "source_paths": ["studies[13].extraction.mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism", "studies[13].structured_code_summary.mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism"], "source_record_id": null, "source_record_ids": ["paper-0016::code-0051", "paper-0016::code-0162"], "source_sections": ["extraction", "structured_code_summary"], "status": "coded", "statuses": ["coded"], "study_id": "paper-0016", "value_index": 6}</data>
