    <edge source="paper-0022" target="ivvintegrationlevel::simulation_in_the_loop" id="e0003765">
      <data key="d5">HAS_IVV_LEVEL</data>
      <data key="d6">eps_verification_specific.ivv_integration_level</data>
      <data key="d7">simulation-in-the-loop</data>
      <data key="d8">The highest supported IVV integration level is system-level concept simulation-in-the-loop: the mission model is connected to a space-system simulation model such as STK for parameter input/output and trade-space evaluation, including power sufficiency. This should not be interpreted as an EPS-specific verification procedure, verification matrix, executable check, SIL/HIL, or physical test evidence.</data>
      <data key="d9">Validation and Verification Strategies</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
