      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">learning_curve_or_training_burden</data>
      <data key="d8">The authors note that a fully formed reference model can overwhelm teams new to MBSE/SysML and propose lifecycle-phase models to ease adoption.</data>
      <data key="d9">Section III: 'Providing a fully-formed CubeSat Reference Model could be a bit overwhelming... especially a team that is just becoming familiar with MBSE and SysML.'</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "author_stated", "source_path": "studies[14].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[9]", "source_record_id": "paper-0022::limitation-10", "study_id": "paper-0022"}</data>
