    <edge source="paper-0022" target="reusemechanism::high_level_abstraction" id="e0005612">
      <data key="d5">HAS_REUSE_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism</data>
      <data key="d7">high-level abstraction</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper directly supports a reusable CubeSat reference-model/template, mission-agnostic logical architecture, component library, and concept-trade workflow. It also supports high-level abstraction through logical components without implementation constraints and interface-focused modeling through interface management, data/information flows, and COTS simulation interfaces. Do not code specific-mission model with reusable method only because the current contribution is explicitly generic, not only a specific mission case. Do not code low-dynamics / non-detailed-behavior model: although the current model is high-level/logical, the paper does not present non-detailed behavior itself as the reuse mechanism and also discusses behavior/state/activity diagrams.</data>
      <data key="d9">Provide a CubeSat Reference Model that CubeSat teams can use as starting point for their mission-specific CubeSat model.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"confidences": ["high"], "source_path": null, "source_paths": ["studies[14].extraction.mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism", "studies[14].structured_code_summary.mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism"], "source_record_id": null, "source_record_ids": ["paper-0022::code-0050", "paper-0022::code-0167"], "source_sections": ["extraction", "structured_code_summary"], "status": "coded", "statuses": ["coded"], "study_id": "paper-0022", "value_index": 6}</data>
