      <data key="d7">academic-student-personnel-churn-tailoring</data>
      <data key="d8">The authors explicitly simplify business-agreement/personnel aspects because student personnel change continuously.</data>
      <data key="d9">Section 3.2: academic nanosatellite specificities allow simplifying the structure: requirements are derived from mission objectives; budget is allocated to hardware/software; "schedule and Coast Breakdown Structure can be directly derived from the Product Tree"; "students-driven projects" have changing personnel and "Business Agreement Structure can be neglected."</data>
