    <edge source="paper-0023" target="limitationflag::no_physical_test_or_flight_evidence" id="e0004030">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_physical_test_or_flight_evidence</data>
      <data key="d8">Lifecycle phases mention hardware/software integration and operations, but the paper does not report actual physical integration, testbed, environmental test, operational, or flight results for the MBSE model.</data>
      <data key="d9">Section 3.3: Phase A defines mission system, functional/operational requirements, architecture, and constraints; Phase B develops an engineering model and test hardware/software; Phase C realizes/integrates the flight model and ground station; Phase D covers launch, day-to-day operation, maintenance, and support. Absence-based: no integration/test/operational/flight evidence is included in claim records.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[15].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[5]", "source_record_id": "paper-0023::limitation-06", "study_id": "paper-0023"}</data>
    </edge>
