      <data key="d7">no_quantitative_evaluation</data>
      <data key="d8">Claim records contain traceability examples and process artifacts, but no measured time, cost, defect, reliability, coverage percentage, or schedule outcome.</data>
      <data key="d9">Absence-based: extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence records C1-C8 contain no quantitative effect size; Completed extraction: the paper has a future-work paragraph but no formal limitations, threats-to-validity, quantitative evaluation, baseline comparison, independent validation, model repository, integration-test result, or flight/operations result was found in the markdown.</data>
