    <edge source="paper-0023" target="limitationflag::power_margin_requirement_wording_appears_ambiguous" id="e0004032">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.emergent_limitations[]</data>
      <data key="d7">power-margin-requirement-wording-appears-ambiguous</data>
      <data key="d8">The figure description quotes "The worst-case scenario for the end-of-life power margin should be less than 10%", which is counterintuitive for a margin requirement. Extraction preserves the quote and does not infer a corrected threshold.</data>
      <data key="d9">Fig. 14 description: Power System design requirements include "Power margin", "PV cell" performance/degradation, "Topology", "Batteries recharge", "Power distribution", "Degradation factors", and "Structure"; power distribution requires meeting loads and a protection concept to prevent failure propagation.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
