      <data key="d7">high-level abstraction</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper claims a reusable framework/repository/reference model for university CubeSat/nanosatellite teams, expressed through abstract lifecycle/views and process flows. It also includes generic subsystem/interface architecture and explicitly generalizes beyond MASAT1 in the ConOps. Do not code low-dynamics / non-detailed-behavior model from absence of executable detail alone.</data>
      <data key="d9">The aim of using MBSE for a nanosatellite project is to create a model framework or repository that can be used by university teams (with limited resources) wishing to design CubeSat or Nanosatellite projects.</data>
