      <data key="d7">available tools</data>
      <data key="d8">Tailoring is justified by university nanosatellite scale, first-project/limited resources, student-driven personnel changes, over-specified industrial standards, direct hardware/software budget allocation, schedule/CBS derivation, and tool cost/usability considerations.</data>
      <data key="d9">Section 1: "Sidi Mohammad ben Abdullah University of Fes is currently developing its first MASAT1 nanosatellite project ... However, with our limited resources, we encountered great difficulty in getting the project off to a good start"; "few articles detail the preparation and early phase management of a university nanosatellite mission."</data>
