      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism</data>
      <data key="d7">method guidance</data>
      <data key="d8">The reusable contribution is DSM-based guidance for mapping OPM/CPM/STEP entities across conceptual-to-detailed design. The CubeSat Earth-observation and thermal-control representations are illustrative, mission/subsystem-specific examples; the paper does not claim a reusable CubeSat/EPS template, mission-agnostic architecture, interface-focused spacecraft model, or reusable low-dynamics model.</data>
      <data key="d9">In our work we use DSM to map the core entities from conceptual to detail design. Doing this, we identify the overlaps and gaps in the digital engineering information exchange.</data>
