      <data key="d5">HAS_IVV_LEVEL</data>
      <data key="d6">eps_verification_specific.ivv_integration_level</data>
      <data key="d7">executable/model-based checks</data>
      <data key="d8">The highest supported IVV integration level is executable/model-based checks: Java reads the Papyrus .uml system model, extracts requirement/assumption/constraint data, evaluates parameter-change scenarios, and outputs respected/not-respected requirement constraint flags. This is stronger than a separate verification document or adjacent matrix, but not simulation-in-the-loop, SIL/HIL, or physical integration/test.</data>
      <data key="d9">presents an automatic requirement verification approach from system model data with a java code</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
