    <edge source="paper-0027" target="approachclass::enhanced_mbse" id="e0001664">
      <data key="d5">HAS_APPROACH_CLASS</data>
      <data key="d6">implementation_pathway_tailoring.approach_classification</data>
      <data key="d7">Enhanced MBSE</data>
      <data key="d8">The work combines a SysML/system-model perspective with selected analysis scripts, DSM generation, Nanospace database/API, and report generation, but does not yet demonstrate a fully integrated digital-engineering environment.</data>
      <data key="d9">Orbit propagation, eclipses determination and contact with ground station events - are handled with a GMAT script. Link budget analysis is done with Dosa. Python scripting is used for miscellaneous computations.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"confidences": ["medium"], "source_path": null, "source_paths": ["studies[18].extraction.implementation_pathway_tailoring.approach_classification", "studies[18].structured_code_summary.implementation_pathway_tailoring.approach_classification"], "source_record_id": null, "source_record_ids": ["paper-0027::code-0049", "paper-0027::code-0174"], "source_sections": ["extraction", "structured_code_summary"], "status": "coded", "statuses": ["coded"], "study_id": "paper-0027", "value_index": 1}</data>
    </edge>
