      <data key="d7">simulation-in-the-loop</data>
      <data key="d8">The highest evidenced level is preliminary simulation-in-the-loop checking: requirements/design parameters are in Nanospace, external scripts/simulation tools check power/link/reentry constraints, and results are stored/shared through the Nanospace database/API. This is not trace-linked or model-contained formal EPS V&amp;V, and not SIL/HIL or physical test.</data>
