      <data key="d7">assumptions_or_data_quality_limits</data>
      <data key="d8">The authors use simplified assumptions and rough expert estimates, excluding several important design domains.</data>
      <data key="d9">Section II.B: 'the assumption was made that the orbit will be circular'; Section II.B: 'mission modes are not discussed'; Section II.B: 'neither Attitude Determination and Control System (ADCS), nor radiation or thermal considerations are included.'</data>
