      <data key="d7">database-schema-needs-parameter-semantics</data>
      <data key="d8">Nanospace database currently needs reassessment to include parameter relations and support change propagation/data flow with other tools.</data>
      <data key="d9">Conclusion: 'the current database structure for Nanospace needs to be re-assessed for it to be able to include more parameter details, such as their relations.'</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
