      <data key="d7">interoperability_limitations</data>
      <data key="d8">The authors explicitly identify lifecycle data continuity, tool-to-tool data passing, model exchange, and information-loss problems.</data>
      <data key="d9">Section IV: 'MBSE software connectivity does not come automatically and few models can be exchanged between software without information loss.'</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "author_stated", "source_path": "studies[18].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[9]", "source_record_id": "paper-0027::limitation-10", "study_id": "paper-0027"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0027" target="limitationflag::model_not_available" id="e0004071">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">model_not_available</data>
      <data key="d8">Scripts are described as accessible, but the SysML model and full model/data package are not available in the markdown; footnote links are not preserved in the extraction source.</data>
      <data key="d9">Absence-based: paper states 'a CubeSat model was realised in a SysML tool' but provides no model file or named SysML tool in the markdown.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[18].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[10]", "source_record_id": "paper-0027::limitation-11", "study_id": "paper-0027"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0027" target="limitationflag::no_baseline_or_comparator" id="e0004072">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_baseline_or_comparator</data>
      <data key="d8">No with/without-MBSE or alternative-toolchain comparator is used; authors identify such comparison as future work.</data>
      <data key="d9">Conclusion: 'compare the performance of Nanospace with and without a MBSE vision'</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "author_stated", "source_path": "studies[18].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[3]", "source_record_id": "paper-0027::limitation-04", "study_id": "paper-0027"}</data>
    </edge>
