      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_pre_physical_verification_model</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper has simulation/constraint checks before hardware, but no formal integrated verification-procedure model, verification matrix, test procedure, SIL/HIL, or EPS verification artifact.</data>
      <data key="d9">Completed extraction: verification_validation_artifacts are limited to simulation scenarios, acceptance criteria, and executable checks; integration_test_readiness is not_reported.</data>
