      <data key="d7">no_quantitative_evaluation</data>
      <data key="d8">Although simulations quantify design variables such as DoD and visibility, the claimed MBSE benefits are not quantitatively evaluated with time, cost, defect, traceability, reuse, or user-performance metrics.</data>
