      <data key="d7">none/not reported</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper reports EPS requirements extraction and model-driven power/data budget analysis, but does not present verification matrices, test cases/procedures, acceptance criteria, verify/satisfy trace links, executable verification checks, SIL/HIL, or EPS IVV artifacts integrated in the model. The NSS simulation link is used for preliminary analysis/budget generation, not as an EPS verification procedure.</data>
