      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">assumptions_or_data_quality_limits</data>
      <data key="d8">The authors report simulation-tool approximations and scope assumptions, including eccentricity simplification and exclusion of non-nominal operating modes.</data>
      <data key="d9">Table 9 note: "Because of limitations within the simulation tools used, the ECC has been considered null." Section 5: non-nominal conditions such as detumbling, calibration, or safe modes are excluded.</data>
