      <data key="d7">tool_dependency_or_vendor_lockin</data>
      <data key="d8">The parser currently depends on Gaphor model-file structure, even though the toolchain is open-source rather than proprietary/vendor locked.</data>
      <data key="d9">Section 5: "The parser was tailored specifically for models created with Gaphor"; this "restricts the immediate applicability" to other SysML tools.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "author_stated", "source_path": "studies[19].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[8]", "source_record_id": "paper-0029::limitation-09", "study_id": "paper-0029"}</data>
