      <data key="d5">HAS_MODEL_MATURITY</data>
      <data key="d6">study_context_population.model_maturity</data>
      <data key="d7">conceptual framework</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper proposes a formal framework and reusable generic model/profile, implements a parser and public repository, and demonstrates executable NSS budget simulations for one theoretical mission; it is not validated operationally.</data>
      <data key="d9">Abstract: "developing a generic CubeSat model using Systems modeling language (SysML)" and creating "an end-to-end use case scenario within the Nanostar software suite".</data>
