    <edge source="paper-0029" target="toolchainlimitation::missing_interfaces" id="e0006234">
      <data key="d5">HAS_TOOLCHAIN_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">toolchain_interoperability_lifecycle_continuity.toolchain_limitations</data>
      <data key="d7">missing interfaces</data>
      <data key="d8">The parser is currently Gaphor-specific and lacks direct interfaces/extraction support for other modeling tools without source-code modification; this is an explicit interoperability limitation, not a proprietary vendor-lock-in limitation.</data>
      <data key="d9">Section 5: "as a drawback, the current state-of-the-art model parser does not allow data to be automatically extracted from models developed with tools other than Gaphor without modifying the source code."</data>
