      <data key="d7">single_case_or_limited_scope</data>
      <data key="d8">The current phase reports a generic logical reference model down to subsystem level and states boundary exclusions; earlier practical application is summarized mainly through RAX.</data>
      <data key="d9">The effort to date has been focused on... defining the generic CubeSat architecture down to the logical subsystem level.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
