    <edge source="paper-0031" target="reusemechanism::high_level_abstraction" id="e0005655">
      <data key="d5">HAS_REUSE_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism</data>
      <data key="d7">high-level abstraction</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper presents a generic CubeSat Reference Model/logical architecture to be distributed and tailored into mission-specific CubeSat models. High-level abstraction and mission-agnostic architecture are supported by the logical, generic subsystem architecture. Interface mentions are not enough to code interface-focused model, and the paper does not claim limited/non-detailed behavior as the reuse mechanism.</data>
      <data key="d9">The CubeSat Reference Model will provide the logical architecture. These logical elements can be reused for specifying a mission specific CubeSat.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"confidences": ["high"], "source_path": null, "source_paths": ["studies[20].extraction.mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism", "studies[20].structured_code_summary.mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism"], "source_record_id": null, "source_record_ids": ["paper-0031::code-0051", "paper-0031::code-0164"], "source_sections": ["extraction", "structured_code_summary"], "status": "coded", "statuses": ["coded"], "study_id": "paper-0031", "value_index": 3}</data>
