      <data key="d7">reference model</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper presents a generic CubeSat Reference Model/logical architecture to be distributed and tailored into mission-specific CubeSat models. High-level abstraction and mission-agnostic architecture are supported by the logical, generic subsystem architecture. Interface mentions are not enough to code interface-focused model, and the paper does not claim limited/non-detailed behavior as the reuse mechanism.</data>
      <data key="d9">The CubeSat Reference Model will provide the logical architecture. These logical elements can be reused for specifying a mission specific CubeSat.</data>
