    <edge source="paper-0033" target="approachclass::enhanced_mbse" id="e0001667">
      <data key="d5">HAS_APPROACH_CLASS</data>
      <data key="d6">implementation_pathway_tailoring.approach_classification</data>
      <data key="d7">Enhanced MBSE</data>
      <data key="d8">The work uses a system architecture model plus selected model transformation, code generation, and executable simulation support, without a fully integrated digital engineering environment.</data>
      <data key="d9">automatically generate code used as an input for a satellite simulator called ForPlan</data>
