      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">RMM is intended to reduce testing time and control project cost while keeping implementation aligned with customer requirements.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">RMM is intended to reduce the testing time for software applications, ensure the scope of the project is well determined, that its implementation is achieved as per the customer requirements and needs, and that the cost of the project is controlled.</data>
