    <edge source="paper-0034" target="limitationflag::no_pre_physical_verification_model" id="e0004132">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_pre_physical_verification_model</data>
      <data key="d8">For the EPS-focused review question, the paper does not provide an EPS pre-physical verification model; it only maps system/software requirements to test cases in an RMM.</data>
      <data key="d9">It works as a high-level documentation, which maps and traces user requirements with the corresponding test cases. This is intended to ensure that for each and every requirement there is an adequate level of testing successfully fulfilled.</data>
