      <data key="d7">single_case_or_limited_scope</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper presents one typical/NDSAT example focused on CubeSat radio, camera, and OBC requirements rather than multiple missions or a full spacecraft/EPS model.</data>
      <data key="d9">The corresponding RMM matrix with the code and tests mapped to requirements for the NDSAT (example satellite concept) CubeSat Radio and Camera systems is depicted in Fig. 5.</data>
