    <edge source="paper-0034" target="modelmaturity::conceptual_framework" id="e0005169">
      <data key="d5">HAS_MODEL_MATURITY</data>
      <data key="d6">study_context_population.model_maturity</data>
      <data key="d7">conceptual framework</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper explains RML/RMM conceptually and demonstrates an illustrative NDSAT RMM/test-case example, while future work will test efficacy in an actual project.</data>
      <data key="d9">In this paper, the importance of implementing RML into a project lifecycle of an engineering system (such as a CubeSat system) is described. A case study of using requirements mapping matrix (RMM) for requirements validation and verification of a typical CubeSat system is provided.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"confidences": ["high"], "source_path": null, "source_paths": ["studies[22].extraction.study_context_population.model_maturity", "studies[22].structured_code_summary.study_context_population.model_maturity"], "source_record_id": null, "source_record_ids": ["paper-0034::code-0018", "paper-0034::code-0097"], "source_sections": ["extraction", "structured_code_summary"], "status": "coded", "statuses": ["coded"], "study_id": "paper-0034", "value_index": 1}</data>
    </edge>
