      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">Docs-as-code enables automatic generation of synchronized diagrams, tables, text, and manuscripts from model files, reducing manual document-update effort.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">Whether it be diagrams, tables, or text, continuous updating is ensured that any changes affecting dependencies within the mission architecture are kept in sync.</data>
      <data key="d10" />
      <data key="d11">{"claim_id": "paper-0037::claim-02", "source_claim_id": "C2", "source_path": "studies[23].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[1]", "source_record_id": "paper-0037::claim-02", "study_id": "paper-0037"}</data>
    </edge>
