      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">The lightweight YAML/M30ML docs-as-code approach is easy for new CubeSat team members to learn and use with minimal training and no proprietary software.</data>
