      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">The MBSE/docs-as-code approach is intended to improve CubeSat success rates and mission assurance for university teams by improving planning, documentation, project management, and simplicity.</data>
