      <data key="d7">none/not reported</data>
      <data key="d8">The EPS model contains architecture, relationships, and power-budget information, but the paper does not report verification matrices, model-contained test artifacts, trace-linked V&amp;V artifacts, executable checks, simulation-in-the-loop, SIL/HIL, or tool-connected IVV. The watchdog/power relationship is a change-propagation relation, not an IVV procedure.</data>
