      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">The integrated MBSE/simulation framework reduces integration costs, misinterpretation risk, late-stage surprises, and rework.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">Results show improved consistency between system models and simulation artifacts, reduced integration costs, and improved early validation of design choices.</data>
