      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">Open-source tools and public MOSAiC assets improve accessibility, reproducibility, collaboration, and potential community-driven evolution for academic/resource-constrained teams.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
