      <data key="d7">simulation-in-the-loop</data>
      <data key="d8">The highest supported IVV integration level is simulation-in-the-loop: Capella/PVMT model data are extracted into dynamic simulations that check requirements, preconditions, power balance, battery sufficiency, and communication feasibility before hardware. Do not upgrade to software/hardware-in-the-loop because HIL/digital twin integration is only future work.</data>
      <data key="d9">Unlike earlier qualitative/exploratory phases, this stage features a direct linkage between formal requirement specifications and simulation results.</data>
