      <data key="d7">co-simulation-data-exchange-standard-not-specified-in-detail</data>
      <data key="d8">Although the abstract refers to standardized data exchanges and co-simulation strategies, the paper mainly describes a custom parser and does not specify a concrete standard/API for tool interoperability in the markdown.</data>
