    <edge source="paper-0043" target="limitationflag::incomplete_lifecycle_coverage" id="e0004189">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">incomplete_lifecycle_coverage</data>
      <data key="d8">Although the framework is designed with the lifecycle in mind, the demonstrated evidence focuses on early design, logical/physical architecture, and simulation; implementation, AIV/T, and operations are not evidenced.</data>
      <data key="d9">While originally conceived as a tool to support early design phases, simulation continues to play a critical role throughout system development</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[26].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[6]", "source_record_id": "paper-0043::limitation-07", "study_id": "paper-0043"}</data>
