      <data key="d7">no-explicit-requirements-table-or-verification-matrix-shown</data>
      <data key="d8">Requirements verification is discussed and linked to simulations, but explicit requirement identifiers, acceptance thresholds, verification matrix, or test procedure artifacts are not reported in the extracted markdown.</data>
      <data key="d9">Unlike earlier qualitative/exploratory phases, this stage features a direct linkage between formal requirement specifications and simulation results.</data>
