    <edge source="paper-0046" target="ivvintegrationlevel::none_not_reported" id="e0003777">
      <data key="d5">HAS_IVV_LEVEL</data>
      <data key="d6">eps_verification_specific.ivv_integration_level</data>
      <data key="d7">none/not reported</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper reports conceptual-design data links and trace/navigation features, but no verification matrix, trace-linked V&amp;V artifacts, executable checks, simulation-in-the-loop, SIL/HIL, or physical integration/test evidence. It explicitly states OPAL is not an effective requirements-verification tool in its current state.</data>
      <data key="d9">OPAL has very limited representation of the extensive requirements found in the CubeSat project. It cannot be used as an effective requirements verification tool in this state.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"confidences": ["high"], "source_path": null, "source_paths": ["studies[27].extraction.eps_verification_specific.ivv_integration_level", "studies[27].structured_code_summary.eps_verification_specific.ivv_integration_level"], "source_record_id": null, "source_record_ids": ["paper-0046::code-0056", "paper-0046::code-0139"], "source_sections": ["extraction", "structured_code_summary"], "status": "none", "statuses": ["none"], "study_id": "paper-0046", "value_index": 1}</data>
    </edge>
