      <data key="d7">assumptions_or_data_quality_limits</data>
      <data key="d8">The post-hoc file survey could miss version history and deleted/redundant analysis files; student-team data may underrepresent needed qualitative behavior descriptions.</data>
      <data key="d9">there may be data lost that may have been captured if the survey was done concurrently e.g. analysis files that were deleted due to being deemed redundant.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
