      <data key="d7">interoperability_limitations</data>
      <data key="d8">The proof-of-concept uses manual links/live files, lacks iteration tracking, and may require a separate requirements-management tool with integration issues.</data>
      <data key="d9">a parallel tool built upon alternate ontology and semantics would be needed for requirements management, possibly creating an integration issue between OPAL and other data tools.</data>
