      <data key="d7">weak_claim_evidence_linkage</data>
      <data key="d8">Claims about easier tracking, finding, and change management are directly linked to OPAL but rely on a single short student evaluation without objective baseline measures.</data>
      <data key="d9">The testing procedure involved a ~15-min introduction to the SAPPhIRE model and OPAL, and then immediately proceeded to the evaluation, which took an average of 45 min.</data>
