      <data key="d7">high-level abstraction</data>
      <data key="d8">SAPPhIRE supplies a repeated element structure/template and causal pattern applied across subsystem views, with case-derived method guidance. OPAL also uses a high-level system abstraction and explicit subsystem-interface navigation. However, the implemented model is SpudNik-1-specific and not a demonstrated mission-agnostic architecture, library, open package, or reusable reference model.</data>
      <data key="d9">OPAL-1 Each subsystem representation shall incorporate the original SAPPhIRE Model with all its elements accounted for</data>
