    <edge source="paper-0046" target="toolchainlimitation::manual_translation" id="e0006246">
      <data key="d5">HAS_TOOLCHAIN_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">toolchain_interoperability_lifecycle_continuity.toolchain_limitations</data>
      <data key="d7">manual translation</data>
      <data key="d8">The proof-of-concept relies on manually created links/live files and lacks requirements-management integration, creating a likely integration issue with parallel tools.</data>
