      <data key="d7">concept/pre-Phase A</data>
      <data key="d8">The work concerns preliminary mission formulation, feasibility, and pre-sizing; later A/B/C/D use is described only as possible future extension.</data>
      <data key="d9">At CNES, PASO (Orbital Systems Architecture Plateau) is leading space systems preliminary phases and aims at formulating missions needs and pre-sizing systems in order to conclude on their feasibility.</data>
