    <edge source="paper-0053" target="approachclass::extended_mbse" id="e0001674">
      <data key="d5">HAS_APPROACH_CLASS</data>
      <data key="d6">implementation_pathway_tailoring.approach_classification</data>
      <data key="d7">Extended MBSE</data>
      <data key="d8">The approach connects system/mission description, common database, plugins, and power simulations across multiple experts and domains, but does not show full digital-engineering continuity into downstream hardware/software integration or V&amp;V.</data>
      <data key="d9">each architect therefore works in conjunction with each other thanks to a common database</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
