      <data key="d6">eps_verification_specific.ivv_integration_level</data>
      <data key="d7">simulation-in-the-loop</data>
      <data key="d8">The highest evidenced pre-physical IVV integration is simulation-in-the-loop: power profiles and ephemeris-derived energy flows are imported/generated through tool connections and used in Opalis simulations to check energy balance and SOC margins. The paper does not show trace-linked verification artifacts, a verification matrix, model-contained test procedures, SIL/HIL, or physical integration/test evidence.</data>
