      <data key="d7">model_not_available</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper does not report public availability of IDM-CIC/Simu-CIC/Opalis models, scenario files, power profiles, scripts, or data packages.</data>
      <data key="d9">No repository, supplementary material, model download, or reusable package is mentioned in the supplied markdown.</data>
