      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_baseline_or_comparator</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper does not compare the MBSE/concurrent workflow against a document-centric process, manual analysis, previous mission, or alternative toolchain.</data>
      <data key="d9">Design alternatives are explored inside the workflow, but no baseline comparator is reported for the claimed MBSE outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[28].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[3]", "source_record_id": "paper-0053::limitation-04", "study_id": "paper-0053"}</data>
