      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_physical_test_or_flight_evidence</data>
      <data key="d8">The evidence is preliminary simulation and architecture analysis only; no hardware, flat-sat, environmental, operational, or flight validation is reported.</data>
      <data key="d9">At CNES, PASO (Orbital Systems Architecture Plateau) is leading space systems preliminary phases and aims at formulating missions needs and pre-sizing systems in order to conclude on their feasibility.</data>
