      <data key="d7">no_quantitative_evaluation</data>
      <data key="d8">Although the EPS simulations are quantitative, the claimed MBSE/process outcomes such as ease, smooth workflow, and interoperability are not evaluated quantitatively.</data>
      <data key="d9">No time, effort, defect, interoperability-error, stakeholder-rating, or reuse metric is reported for the MBSE/concurrent-engineering process outcomes.</data>
