      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">prototype_or_future_work</data>
      <data key="d8">The demonstrated process is for preliminary phases; extension to later phases is described conditionally rather than demonstrated.</data>
      <data key="d9">The presented use case describes the process for preliminary phases, involving the laboratory and the space agency, but it could also be implemented for phases A/B/C/D by adding a satellite manufacturer/provider in the loop as long as the files standard is still respected.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
