    <edge source="paper-0054" target="approachclass::enhanced_mbse" id="e0001675">
      <data key="d5">HAS_APPROACH_CLASS</data>
      <data key="d6">implementation_pathway_tailoring.approach_classification</data>
      <data key="d7">Enhanced MBSE</data>
      <data key="d8">The approach is a system model plus selected analysis/simulation/trade-study support, with a planned data-management IDM; it is not yet an integrated digital engineering environment through downstream hardware/software verification.</data>
      <data key="d9">In the context of the BOREALIS mission, MBSE has been integral to aligning complex biological and engineering requirements within the constraints of a CubeSat platform. In the first stage of the mission, a satellite model to evaluate the performance of its different configurations has been developed</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"confidences": ["high"], "source_path": null, "source_paths": ["studies[29].extraction.implementation_pathway_tailoring.approach_classification", "studies[29].structured_code_summary.implementation_pathway_tailoring.approach_classification"], "source_record_id": null, "source_record_ids": ["paper-0054::code-0045", "paper-0054::code-0158"], "source_sections": ["extraction", "structured_code_summary"], "status": "coded", "statuses": ["coded"], "study_id": "paper-0054", "value_index": 1}</data>
    </edge>
