      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">Monte Carlo and sensitivity analyses make the architecture decision robust against uncertainty and subjective weight variation.</data>
