      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">The workflow is reusable/adaptable for other CubeSat missions of the same or similar class.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">Emphasis will be given to the model built for the tradeoff analysis, explaining how it was built and used and providing the reader with all the elements to possibly reuse it for another mission design of the same satellite class.</data>
