      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">The structured workflow improves traceability and repeatability from requirements and constraints to architectural decisions and concepts.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">Unlike traditional document-centric approaches, MBSE employs a model-driven framework to manage requirements, design, analysis, and validation within a centralized environment, which greatly enhances collaboration and traceability across multidisciplinary teams.</data>
      <data key="d10" />
      <data key="d11">{"claim_id": "paper-0054::claim-04", "source_claim_id": "C4", "source_path": "studies[29].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[3]", "source_record_id": "paper-0054::claim-04", "study_id": "paper-0054"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0054" target="paper-0054::claim-05" id="e0002158">
      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">A Valispace-based integrated design model will improve collaborative lifecycle continuity and real-time subsystem-data management.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">Integrated Design Model (IDM): Once the mission concept baseline is chosen, a dynamic model hosted within Valispace environment [47] that integrates all subsystems will be developed, facilitating real-time updates and collaborative design efforts across different teams.</data>
      <data key="d10" />
      <data key="d11">{"claim_id": "paper-0054::claim-05", "source_claim_id": "C5", "source_path": "studies[29].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[4]", "source_record_id": "paper-0054::claim-05", "study_id": "paper-0054"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0054" target="paper-0054::claim-06" id="e0002159">
      <data key="d5">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">Generic MBSE use can reduce development time, mitigate late design-change risks, enhance collaboration, and support early issue identification in complex space systems.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">This centralized model enables engineers to perform early-stage simulations, identify potential issues, and make informed trade-offs, ultimately reducing development time and mitigating risks associated with late-stage design changes.</data>
      <data key="d10" />
      <data key="d11">{"claim_id": "paper-0054::claim-06", "source_claim_id": "C6", "source_path": "studies[29].extraction.claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[5]", "source_record_id": "paper-0054::claim-06", "study_id": "paper-0054"}</data>
    </edge>
