    <edge source="paper-0054" target="limitationflag::incomplete_lifecycle_coverage" id="e0004230">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">incomplete_lifecycle_coverage</data>
      <data key="d8">The article focuses on concept selection and early design; detailed Valispace data management, implementation, integration, test, and flight operations are outside scope or planned.</data>
      <data key="d9">This study explores the systematic application of Model-Based Systems Engineering to satellite design, from conceptualisation to trade-offs... the model under development on Valispace to manage the actual CubeSat data is not the purpose of this article.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "author_stated", "source_path": "studies[29].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[9]", "source_record_id": "paper-0054::limitation-10", "study_id": "paper-0054"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0054" target="limitationflag::interoperability_limitations" id="e0004231">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">interoperability_limitations</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper names a future Valispace/Excel/scripts chain but does not report semantic exchange mechanisms, APIs, ReqIF/XMI, or demonstrated trace continuity across tools.</data>
      <data key="d9">Absence-based: interoperability_mechanisms were limited to spreadsheets and scripts; the authors state the Valispace IDM 'will be developed' and do not specify an API/import/export standard.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[29].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[7]", "source_record_id": "paper-0054::limitation-08", "study_id": "paper-0054"}</data>
    </edge>
