      <data key="d7">mbse-operationalized-without-formal-systems-modeling-language</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper does not report SysML, Capella/Arcadia, Cameo, or a formal metamodel; its MBSE contribution is a custom analytical tradespace model and a future Valispace data model.</data>
      <data key="d9">The multiple mission concepts were evaluated using Multi-Attribute Utility (MAU) and cost functions... Valispace is chosen as the main software platform to manage all mission design data.</data>
