      <data key="d7">high-level abstraction</data>
      <data key="d8">The reusable contribution is a high-level architectural-decision and MAU/cost trade-study workflow with adaptation guidance for similar CubeSat missions. The actual model is BOREALIS-specific and requires retuning of ADs, weights, utility/cost functions, and performance parameters; it is not a mission-agnostic architecture, template, open package, interface-focused model, or detailed reusable behavior model.</data>
