      <data key="d7">Extended MBSE</data>
      <data key="d8">The approach connects mission/system/subsystem disciplines, databases, and external analysis tools through a shared repository, but does not reach a fully integrated digital-engineering chain with formal V&amp;V/downstream integration.</data>
