      <data key="d7">interoperability_limitations</data>
      <data key="d8">Some external analysis sheets are not linked to discipline spreadsheets and must be populated manually.</data>
      <data key="d9">The Mission Analysis and the Structure &amp; Configuration sheets are not linked to any spreadsheet because external software (e.g. Systems Tool Kit (STK), SolidWorks) are used for specific analyses. Therefore, the 'Inputs' and 'Outputs' tables of both sheets must be filled in by the user.</data>
