      <data key="d9">It allows to notice gaps in the data exchange between ontologies which are used at the appropriate stages of product development, and determine relationships that are necessary in order to most fully and representatively transfer data from the stage of conceptual design to the detailed design.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "author_stated", "source_path": "studies[33].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[8]", "source_record_id": "paper-0068::limitation-09", "study_id": "paper-0068"}</data>
