    <edge source="paper-0068" target="limitationflag::no_eps_specific_evidence" id="e0004291">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_eps_specific_evidence</data>
      <data key="d8">Although Power System is listed in the generic CubeSat decomposition, no EPS elements, requirements, power budgets, or EPS outcomes are modeled; the detailed subsystem example is thermal control.</data>
