    <edge source="paper-0068" target="reusemechanism::high_level_abstraction" id="e0005721">
      <data key="d5">HAS_REUSE_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism</data>
      <data key="d7">high-level abstraction</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper supports a reusable method/workflow for OPM-to-DSM/DMM-to-CPM information exchange, using high-level and interface-focused representations. The worked model remains a CubeSat/Thermal Control/Radiator case, so it should be treated as a specific-mission/model case with a reusable method, not as a reusable mission-agnostic architecture or template. The paper does not directly justify low-dynamics/non-detailed behavior as a reuse mechanism.</data>
      <data key="d9">The utility of the proposed approach is that it keeps the same principles regardless of the level of decomposition.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
