      <data key="d7">risk-management-modeling</data>
      <data key="d8">Open extraction observation not fully represented by the controlled vocabulary.</data>
      <data key="d9">Abstract: this paper expedites a novel idea of implementing a Model-Based Approach to assess and manage the risks faced by RVSAT-1, a student nano-satellite project, using SysML; Introduction: This paper focuses on the application of the model-based approach to the process of risk management in RVSAT-1 in order to obviate the shortcomings of the conventional document-based approach, and cater to the needs of student teams.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"category": null, "description": "The central modeled domain is risk management, a scope not listed in the controlled modeling-scope vocabulary.", "original_label": "risk-management modeling", "source_path": "studies[34].emergent_codes[0]", "source_record_id": "paper-0071::emergent-01", "study_id": "paper-0071"}</data>
    </edge>
