      <data key="d9">Risk Precedence Index [RPI]: Risk Precedence Index for this proposal is defined as the product of the severity index number and the likelihood index number.; Risk Precedence Index [RPI]: This representation helps in providing a quick overview of the risks associated with the system or any of the subsystems of the project.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"category": null, "description": "Risk severity and likelihood are combined into RPI and visualized with high/medium/low color coding.", "original_label": "Risk Precedence Index and Risk Precedence Cube color-coding", "source_path": "studies[34].emergent_codes[2]", "source_record_id": "paper-0071::emergent-03", "study_id": "paper-0071"}</data>
