      <data key="d8">Open extraction observation not fully represented by the controlled vocabulary.</data>
      <data key="d9">Introduction: student teams encounter several unprecedented problems ranging from lack of access to research facilities and inefficient logistics to uncertainties in funding and academic schedules; Introduction: As the environment and constraints they work under are contrasting to those found in the industry, the straightforward application of these standards seem inefficient.</data>
