      <data key="d7">incomplete_lifecycle_coverage</data>
      <data key="d8">Although the MSM is claimed to be maintained through development and operations, detailed evidence is concentrated on logical/physical architecture and conceptual V&amp;V relationships; software/hardware integration and operations artifacts are not detailed.</data>
      <data key="d9">The MSM is maintained throughout all phases of development and operations as the single and central design baseline.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
