      <data key="d7">unnamed-graphical-modeling-tool</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper repeatedly refers to a graphical modeling tool but does not identify the tool, version, configuration, or import/export procedure beyond XMI/web forms.</data>
      <data key="d9">Our application of MBSE is demonstrated using Systems Modeling Language (SysML) and a graphical modeling tool.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "emergent_limitation", "limitation_type": "emergent_limitation", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[35].structured_limitations.emergent_limitations[0]", "source_record_id": "paper-0077::limitation-12", "study_id": "paper-0077"}</data>
