    <edge source="paper-0077" target="modelingscope::architecture" id="e0005044">
      <data key="d5">HAS_MODELING_SCOPE</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.modeling_scope</data>
      <data key="d7">architecture</data>
      <data key="d8">The CSRM covers mission-specific stakeholders/needs, CubeSat space and ground system architecture, subsystem/component hierarchies, use cases/behaviors, component interfaces/properties, V&amp;V activities, operations concepts via use cases, and test/procedure artifacts. 'Other' captures stakeholders, technical measures, regulatory/deployer stakeholders, and project-management artifacts. Budget-like properties are mentioned, but executable budget analysis is not reported.</data>
      <data key="d9">This paper provides an overview of the CSRM including the requirements hierarchy, architecture hierarchy, and the incorporation of stakeholders, technical measures, and use cases.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
