    <edge source="paper-0077" target="modelmaturity::prototype_demonstration" id="e0005201">
      <data key="d5">HAS_MODEL_MATURITY</data>
      <data key="d6">study_context_population.model_maturity</data>
      <data key="d7">prototype demonstration</data>
      <data key="d8">The CSRM is a reference model implemented in a graphical modeling tool and described as sufficiently mature for validation, but reported application/evaluation by mission teams remains prospective.</data>
