      <data key="d7">trace-linked verification artifacts</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper reports Capella trace links from requirements to functions, components, verification test cases, and validation criteria. It also reports external analyses/simulations, but does not show tool connections, executable model-based checks, simulation-in-the-loop integration, SIL/HIL, or physical test evidence. Therefore the current simulation-in-the-loop coding is overstated.</data>
