      <data key="d8">EPS is modeled through power budgets and architecture, but the paper's MBSE outcome claims are system-level/agile-process claims; no EPS-specific MBSE outcome evaluation is isolated.</data>
      <data key="d9">The EPS section reports power budgets and components, while outcome sections discuss overall mission design consistency, communication, schedule, and reliability without EPS-only effect measures.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[36].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[5]", "source_record_id": "paper-0078::limitation-06", "study_id": "paper-0078"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0078" target="limitationflag::no_independent_validation" id="e0004333">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_independent_validation</data>
      <data key="d8">Outcome claims are made by the project team in a single case; the paper reports no external audit, independent stakeholder evaluation, repeated replication, or independently validated MBSE outcome assessment.</data>
      <data key="d9">Completed outcome extraction found only author-reported single-case evidence, simulations, and schedule statements; no independent evaluator or external validation of MBSE outcomes is reported.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[36].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[3]", "source_record_id": "paper-0078::limitation-04", "study_id": "paper-0078"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0078" target="limitationflag::no_physical_test_or_flight_evidence" id="e0004334">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_physical_test_or_flight_evidence</data>
      <data key="d8">The mission design has not proceeded to subsystem manufacturing, physical tests, launch, or operations in the paper.</data>
      <data key="d9">Although actual manufacturing of the subsystems has not yet started, comprehensive design activities were undertaken to lay a solid foundation for future development and integration.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "author_stated", "source_path": "studies[36].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[4]", "source_record_id": "paper-0078::limitation-05", "study_id": "paper-0078"}</data>
    </edge>
