      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">prototype_or_future_work</data>
      <data key="d8">The work is at preliminary design/proposal stage, with future implementation/testing and future comparative work planned.</data>
      <data key="d9">Concerning the implementation and testing stages of the 3ColStar project, the development team will adopt a Scrum-inspired methodology</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "author_stated", "source_path": "studies[36].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[0]", "source_record_id": "paper-0078::limitation-01", "study_id": "paper-0078"}</data>
