    <edge source="paper-0078" target="reusemechanism::method_guidance" id="e0005739">
      <data key="d5">HAS_REUSE_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism</data>
      <data key="d7">method guidance</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper is a 3ColStar-specific case study. Its reusable contribution is the Arcadia/Capella plus Agile workflow and guidance, not a reusable mission-agnostic model, template, library, open package, or reference architecture. High-level/logical abstraction and interface modeling are present, but the paper does not demonstrate those model features as reusable beyond this mission.</data>
      <data key="d9">This paper presents a case study on integrating Agile Systems Engineering methodologies in the preliminary design phase of satellite systems, focusing on the 3ColStar satellite mission.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"confidences": ["medium"], "source_path": null, "source_paths": ["studies[36].extraction.mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism", "studies[36].structured_code_summary.mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism"], "source_record_id": null, "source_record_ids": ["paper-0078::code-0049", "paper-0078::code-0177"], "source_sections": ["extraction", "structured_code_summary"], "status": "coded", "statuses": ["coded"], "study_id": "paper-0078", "value_index": 2}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0078" target="reusemechanism::reusable_workflow" id="e0005740">
      <data key="d5">HAS_REUSE_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism</data>
      <data key="d7">reusable workflow</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper is a 3ColStar-specific case study. Its reusable contribution is the Arcadia/Capella plus Agile workflow and guidance, not a reusable mission-agnostic model, template, library, open package, or reference architecture. High-level/logical abstraction and interface modeling are present, but the paper does not demonstrate those model features as reusable beyond this mission.</data>
      <data key="d9">This paper presents a case study on integrating Agile Systems Engineering methodologies in the preliminary design phase of satellite systems, focusing on the 3ColStar satellite mission.</data>
