    <edge source="paper-0079" target="ivvintegrationlevel::simulation_in_the_loop" id="e0003786">
      <data key="d5">HAS_IVV_LEVEL</data>
      <data key="d6">eps_verification_specific.ivv_integration_level</data>
      <data key="d7">simulation-in-the-loop</data>
      <data key="d8">The highest demonstrated integration level is SysML-driven MATLAB/Simulink simulation-in-the-loop for ADCS/system verification: a requirement is refined to a constraint, tool-connected simulation runs, and results update SysML requirement status. The HIL/flight-model path is described as a downstream/foreseen workflow and should not be the coded highest level. No EPS-specific IVV is demonstrated.</data>
      <data key="d9">ADCSF.34 is connected to a constraint block by means of 'refine' relationship. This is the way SysML adopts indicate that a requirement can be analyzed executi parametric models.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"confidences": ["high"], "source_path": null, "source_paths": ["studies[37].extraction.eps_verification_specific.ivv_integration_level", "studies[37].structured_code_summary.eps_verification_specific.ivv_integration_level"], "source_record_id": null, "source_record_ids": ["paper-0079::code-0069", "paper-0079::code-0184"], "source_sections": ["extraction", "structured_code_summary"], "status": "coded", "statuses": ["coded"], "study_id": "paper-0079", "value_index": 1}</data>
