    <edge source="paper-0079" target="modelingscope::architecture" id="e0005069">
      <data key="d5">HAS_MODELING_SCOPE</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.modeling_scope</data>
      <data key="d7">architecture</data>
      <data key="d8">Scope covers mission/system/subsystem requirements, ADCS behavior and simulation verification, subsystem power budgets/EPS mention, and downstream software/HIL/FM/operation workflow; 'other' captures onboard software/code generation.</data>
      <data key="d9">This paper presented a gap-filling methodology utilizing Model-Based Systems Engineering (MBSE) in support of nano-satellite development. Using a satellite mission as case study, this paper focuses two particular aspects of applying MBSE: requirements development and design validation, and their linkinboard software development.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
      <data key="d11">{"confidences": ["medium"], "source_path": null, "source_paths": ["studies[37].extraction.mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.modeling_scope", "studies[37].structured_code_summary.mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.modeling_scope"], "source_record_id": null, "source_record_ids": ["paper-0079::code-0029", "paper-0079::code-0144"], "source_sections": ["extraction", "structured_code_summary"], "status": "coded", "statuses": ["coded"], "study_id": "paper-0079", "value_index": 6}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0079" target="modelingscope::behavior" id="e0005070">
      <data key="d5">HAS_MODELING_SCOPE</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.modeling_scope</data>
      <data key="d7">behavior</data>
      <data key="d8">Scope covers mission/system/subsystem requirements, ADCS behavior and simulation verification, subsystem power budgets/EPS mention, and downstream software/HIL/FM/operation workflow; 'other' captures onboard software/code generation.</data>
      <data key="d9">This paper presented a gap-filling methodology utilizing Model-Based Systems Engineering (MBSE) in support of nano-satellite development. Using a satellite mission as case study, this paper focuses two particular aspects of applying MBSE: requirements development and design validation, and their linkinboard software development.</data>
      <data key="d10">medium</data>
