      <data key="d8">The paper supports reusable templates/guidelines, step workflows, and MATLAB/Simulink model libraries, but the demonstrated SysML/executable case remains DelFFi/ADCS-specific. Do not retain interface-focused model: interfaces/tool links are present, but the reuse mechanism is not an interface-focused architecture. Do not add high-level abstraction, mission-agnostic architecture, or low-dynamics / non-detailed-behavior model; detailed ADCS dynamics and mission-specific parameters are central.</data>
      <data key="d9">The definition of guidelines associated to a welldefined template is observed to be of vital importa in order to apply the MBSE approach, and to actual make the model reusable.</data>
