      <data key="d7">available tools</data>
      <data key="d8">Rationale is tied to nanosatellite development misalignment, faster response/reduced design time, and reuse of available SysML/MATLAB/Simulink/ParaSolver tooling.</data>
      <data key="d9">This paper aims at filling the aforementioned ... misalignment by utilizing Model-Based Systems ... Engineering (MBSE) in support of nano-satellite development. Using the DelFFi mission of the Delft ... University of Technology (TUD) as a case study ... focuses on two particular aspects of applying ... MBSE: requirements development and design ... validation, and their link with onboard software development.</data>
