      <data key="d7">acceptance criteria</data>
      <data key="d8">The demonstrated artifacts include ADCS mode simulation scenarios, a detumble acceptance criterion, executable requirement-status checking, and planned HIL/code-verification links; these are not EPS-specific.</data>
      <data key="d9">To automatically verify the ADCS design satisfy requirements, simulations are performed from SysML, aiming at investigating the satellite behavior in the five ADCS modes, i.e. detumble, coarse sun pointing, fine sun pointing, thruster pointing and ground station tracking. Here only the verification the detumble mode is presented.</data>
