      <data key="d6">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d7">SysML diagrams improve communication and make missing or relevant design information easier to find.</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d9">Users, project managers, analysts, developers, quality-assurance engineers, and anyone else interested in the system as a whole can inspect these diagrams and understand what the system is supposed to accomplish.</data>
