      <data key="d7">executable/model-based checks</data>
      <data key="d8">The highest supported IVV integration level is executable/model-based checks: SysML requirements are linked by verify relationships to constraint blocks, and ParaMagic/MATLAB SMT solves the mass/power margins. This is not simulation-in-the-loop, SIL/HIL, or detailed EPS test integration.</data>
