      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">incomplete_lifecycle_coverage</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper maps lifecycle phases conceptually, but the implemented demonstration focuses on early system model and budget verification; full NSS-2/MBSE and STK integration are future work.</data>
