      <data key="d7">interoperability_limitations</data>
      <data key="d8">Authors explicitly identify model/tool integration as a challenge and leave direct STK-SysML integration to future work.</data>
      <data key="d9">Integration among the models and tools, and other engineering artifacts, is another challenge associated with MBSE.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "author_stated", "source_path": "studies[38].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[8]", "source_record_id": "paper-0080::limitation-09", "study_id": "paper-0080"}</data>
