      <data key="d7">learning_curve_or_training_burden</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper states that engineers must learn SysML, tools, OO concepts, and domain application before benefits emerge.</data>
      <data key="d9">The SysML learning curve is steep. It may require considerable knowledge of software engineering and OOP by satellite system engineers before its advantages come out.</data>
