      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">model_not_available</data>
      <data key="d8">No accessible SysML repository, model files, scripts, spreadsheets, or package link is reported in the paper text or metadata provided.</data>
      <data key="d9">Absence-based: model repository examples are shown in figures, but no availability statement or download location is provided.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[38].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[10]", "source_record_id": "paper-0080::limitation-11", "study_id": "paper-0080"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0080" target="limitationflag::no_baseline_or_comparator" id="e0004363">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_baseline_or_comparator</data>
      <data key="d8">Traditional/document-centric and manual practices are described as problems, but no measured baseline comparison is reported for outcome claims.</data>
      <data key="d9">In traditional SE approach, it becomes difficult to assess the completeness and consistency of information spread across tools and documents.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[38].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[3]", "source_record_id": "paper-0080::limitation-04", "study_id": "paper-0080"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0080" target="limitationflag::no_eps_specific_evidence" id="e0004364">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_eps_specific_evidence</data>
      <data key="d8">EPS is represented only at block/power-budget level; there is no detailed EPS architecture, solar/battery model, EPS fault protection, EPS reliability evidence, or EPS-specific test procedure evidence.</data>
      <data key="d9">The power constraint on EPS subsystem is computed based on power demanded by electronic subsystems.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[38].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[6]", "source_record_id": "paper-0080::limitation-07", "study_id": "paper-0080"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0080" target="limitationflag::no_independent_validation" id="e0004365">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_independent_validation</data>
      <data key="d8">No independent stakeholder, external expert, peer-user, or third-party validation of model usefulness or outcomes is reported in the accessible text.</data>
      <data key="d9">Absence-based: the extraction found an internal NSS-1 case demonstration and author conclusions, but no independent evaluation section, user study, or external validation evidence.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[38].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[4]", "source_record_id": "paper-0080::limitation-05", "study_id": "paper-0080"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0080" target="limitationflag::no_physical_test_or_flight_evidence" id="e0004366">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_physical_test_or_flight_evidence</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper maps future/phase-D test artifacts but does not report physical integration, environmental test, flat-sat, operation, or flight evidence.</data>
      <data key="d9">Certain testing activities during the assembly integration and testing phase are supported by SysML diagrams, enabling test-case design and tracing them back toward the requirements for conformance.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[38].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[5]", "source_record_id": "paper-0080::limitation-06", "study_id": "paper-0080"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="paper-0080" target="limitationflag::no_quantitative_evaluation" id="e0004367">
      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">no_quantitative_evaluation</data>
      <data key="d8">The only quantitative values are engineering budget outputs; no quantitative evaluation of MBSE benefits such as effort, defects, cost, schedule, or productivity is reported.</data>
      <data key="d9">The model-based approach is found to be promising for a reduced development risk, improved quality, and increased productivity.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "extractor_identified", "source_path": "studies[38].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[2]", "source_record_id": "paper-0080::limitation-03", "study_id": "paper-0080"}</data>
    </edge>
