      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">prototype_or_future_work</data>
      <data key="d8">Authors call the work an initial study and defer training, NSS-2 use, and STK/SLIM integration to future work.</data>
      <data key="d9">The work presented in this article is an initial study and modeling to evaluate the effectiveness of the MBSE approach for our satellite design projects.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "author_stated", "source_path": "studies[38].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[0]", "source_record_id": "paper-0080::limitation-01", "study_id": "paper-0080"}</data>
