      <data key="d7">single_case_or_limited_scope</data>
      <data key="d8">Evidence is based on one NSS-1 case and the demonstrated analysis is limited to mass and power budgets.</data>
      <data key="d9">To achieve these objectives, we selected an ongoing remote sensing (RS) student satellite (NSS-1) as a case study</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "author_stated", "source_path": "studies[38].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[1]", "source_record_id": "paper-0080::limitation-02", "study_id": "paper-0080"}</data>
