    <edge source="paper-0080" target="reusemechanism::high_level_abstraction" id="e0005747">
      <data key="d5">HAS_REUSE_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d6">mbse_objective_scope_artifacts.generality_reuse_mechanism</data>
      <data key="d7">high-level abstraction</data>
      <data key="d8">The paper supports reuse through FireSat model-element reuse, common nanosatellite design patterns, OOSEM/PNSSP method guidance, and high-level/generic mission-scenario abstraction. It should not be coded as mission-agnostic architecture, interface-focused model, or low-dynamics / non-detailed-behavior model. The implemented case is NSS-1, but the paper claims model/pattern reuse beyond NSS-1, so 'specific-mission model with reusable method only' is too restrictive.</data>
      <data key="d9">We have used SysML to develop a scalable model repository for RS satellites. A parametric model-based approach has been used that allows generic models of various mission scenarios to be characterized for the study being performed.</data>
