      <data key="d5">HAS_LIMITATION</data>
      <data key="d6">structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[]</data>
      <data key="d7">assumptions_or_data_quality_limits</data>
      <data key="d8">Capella element IDs are assigned only after model generation, so parameter mapping and post-generation operations must handle dynamic identifiers carefully.</data>
      <data key="d9">The mapping of model elements must be performed using the Capella element IDs, which are assigned only after model generation. As a result, this information cannot be pre-defined or included directly in the functional library.</data>
      <data key="d10">high</data>
      <data key="d11">{"assessment": "limitation_present", "limitation_type": "controlled_flag", "source": "author_stated", "source_path": "studies[39].structured_limitations.limitation_assessments[8]", "source_record_id": "paper-0081::limitation-09", "study_id": "paper-0081"}</data>
    </edge>
