    <edge source="paper-0081" target="tool::capella_arcadia" id="e0007856">
      <data key="d5">USES_TOOL</data>
      <data key="d6">toolchain_interoperability_lifecycle_continuity.mbse_language_method_tool</data>
      <data key="d7">Capella/Arcadia</data>
      <data key="d8">The core toolchain is Capella/ARCADIA plus Python/Python4Capella and custom APIs/classes. Open-source Capella/Python4Capella ecosystem tools are central. Other captures FAS, System as Code, OOP, PVMT, Filtering Add-On, and structured data formats.</data>
